---
description: Identify current template migration evidence that can answer the open goal.
args:
  goal: string
  current: MigrationObservation
returns: string[]
---
Use only exact visible record IDs. Compare similarly named candidates whenever the goal questions ownership or whether one has been applied. Read release, dependency, approval, and receipt records that bear on the question. A record title is a lead rather than final authority. Ignore unrelated retained desks.
